% divergence: font-substitution
% Scenario: a substituted font. Arial is not resident; findfont resolves
% it to Helvetica, the job runs, and the distillation report counts the
% substitution, which the command-line tool prints on standard error.
/Arial findfont 12 scalefont setfont
72 72 moveto (Arial) show
showpage
